      "content": "Story Time: There can only be h1 tag!"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Back when I was a student learning HTML for the first time, I created a simple web page for my assignment and showed it to my instructor."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "I was rather proud of my work, but the instructor raised his eyebrow and scolded me for using multiple <h1> tags."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "\"The h1 tag is the title of the page, boy! And a page can only ever have a single title. Google won't like what you did here!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "That scolding was the price I paid for not paying attention in class 😅"
    },
